training program and materials,

00:20:08.990 --> 00:20:12.460
head to
EarthDNA.org/ambassadors.

00:20:12.460 --> 00:20:15.790
You can also find the Climate
101 presentation slides,

00:20:15.790 --> 00:20:19.210
